flowchart TD
  A([Editor in a project]) --> B[Creates or renames a file]
  B --> C{Name free and allowed?}
  C -- no --> E1[/Error under the field, button disabled, screen 6/] --> B
  C -- yes --> D[Writes code and presses Run]
  D --> G{Can it run?}
  G -- not JS or Python --> E3[/Error: file type/]
  G -- access code needed --> H[Enters the code] --> HC{Code right?}
  HC -- no --> E4[/Error: wrong code/] --> H
  HC -- yes --> I
  G -- yes --> I{Runner free?}
  I -- down or busy --> E5[/Error: try later/]
  I -- yes --> J[Program in the sandbox]
  J --> K{Result}
  K -- over 10 s --> E7[/Status: time limit/]
  K -- error in code --> E8[/Status: error, line highlighted/]
  K -- success --> Z([Everyone sees output, status and time])
